      "message": "test: use independent state for each spends_witness_prog check\n\nThe test reused funding transaction, spending transaction and coins view\nfor every output type, modifying them between checks. The P2SH-wrapped\ncases relied on the scriptPubkey left by the previous case, and each one\nhad to clear the scriptSig it set.\n\nBuild fresh transactions and a fresh coins view for each check and name\nthe scripts each case uses. The scripts are unchanged.",
